Jaṭāyu wakes hearing Sītā cry and sees Rāvaṇa --- Jaṭāyu names himself aged sixty-thousand-year king --- Jaṭāyu calls Sītā world-lord Rāma queen --- Jaṭāyu forbids low theft of others wives --- Jaṭāyu warns Rāma eyes will burn thief like Indra bolt --- Jaṭāyu boasts old yet Rāvaṇa shall not pass alive --- Jaṭāyu invites brief stand and threatens Khara fate